#!/usr/bin/env bash

lord --verbose << "EOF"
In master.tex, the source profiles, like these:

\DeclareSourceProfile{PaleoA}
    {\EnglishProtoFont} 	{\color{PaleoColor}\mdseries}
    {\PaleoAFont} 		{\color{PaleoColor}\mdseries}

\DeclareSourceProfile{PaleoB}
    {\EnglishProtoFont} 	{\color{PaleoColor}\mdseries}
    {\PaleoBFont} 		{\color{PaleoColor}\mdseries}

are indented such that they align properly only if tabs are rendered with a width of 8.

Re-lint the file master.tex such that everything is aligned nicely under the assumption
that tabs are used for indenting and that their width displays as a width of 4.
EOF
